# Local env
.env
.env.local

# Generated assets (poster + logo PNGs from the cron). These are
# regenerated on demand and can be large; don't commit.
# Leading slash anchors to backend/ root — without it, the pattern would
# also match internal/data/ (the source-of-truth alias/stub/openai
# package) and `gcloud run deploy --source .` would strip it from the
# upload because it falls back to .gitignore when no .gcloudignore is
# present. Cost us a failed Cloud Build to figure that out.
/data/
